{"id":"a5225783-4697-46f3-85f2-e762f4a2d3ae","rule_id":"79e7291f-9e3b-4a4b-9823-800daa89c8f9","name":"【默认】Linux账号凭据修改","immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"version":6,"revision":8,"updated_at":"2026-09-15T06:09:19.246Z","updated_by":"elastic","created_at":"2026-09-07T03:13:44.247Z","created_by":"elastic","enabled":true,"interval":"5m","from":"now-9m","to":"now","description":"检测可疑的 主机 账号凭据修改行为（如通过 Shell 重定向等方式改写密码相关文件）。对应需求：账号密码重置。","tags":["操作系统: Linux","主题: 身份安全","来源: 默认","规则来源: 默认","用例: 身份与访问审计","对应需求: 账号密码重置"],"author":["Elastic"],"license":"Elastic License v2","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","tactic":{"id":"TA0003","name":"Persistence","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0003/"},"technique":[{"id":"T1098","name":"Account Manipulation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1098/"}]},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","tactic":{"id":"TA0004","name":"Privilege Escalation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0004/"},"technique":[{"id":"T1098","name":"Account Manipulation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1098/"}]}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.args","process.command_line","process.executable","process.parent.name","process.parent.executable","process.parent.command_line","event.action","event.type","agent.id"]},"related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":">=9.0.0"}],"required_fields":[{"name":"event.action","type":"keyword","ecs":true},{"name":"event.type","type":"keyword","ecs":true},{"name":"host.os.type","type":"keyword","ecs":true},{"name":"process.command_line","type":"wildcard","ecs":true},{"name":"process.name","type":"keyword","ecs":true},{"name":"process.parent.command_line","type":"wildcard","ecs":true},{"name":"process.parent.executable","type":"keyword","ecs":true}],"setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend** 与/或 **System** / **auditd**（按规则数据源）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n3. 可用演示脚本做触发验证。\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n发现可疑凭据修改手法。\n\n### 为何重要\n非标准改密路径常用于后门持久化。\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 查看进程命令行与父进程。\n2. 确认目标账号。\n3. 关联登录成功与特权变更。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维操作\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则回滚变更、禁用相关账号并轮换凭证。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后身份类告警。\n","false_positives":["受控的密码管理系统变更"],"references":[],"risk_score":47,"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity":"medium","severity_mapping":[],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","output_index":"","max_signals":100,"exceptions_list":[],"actions":[],"type":"eql","language":"eql","index":["logs-endpoint.events.process*"],"query":"process where host.os.type == \"linux\" and event.type == \"start\" and event.action == \"exec\" and\nprocess.name in (\"bash\", \"dash\", \"sh\", \"tcsh\", \"csh\", \"zsh\", \"ksh\", \"fish\") and\nprocess.command_line like (\n  \"*echo*> /etc/passwd*\", \"*echo*>/etc/passwd*\",\n  \"*echo*> /etc/shadow*\", \"*echo*>/etc/shadow*\"\n) and\nnot (\n  process.parent.command_line == \"runc init\" or\n  process.parent.executable in (\"/usr/bin/make\", \"/bin/make\")\n)\n"}
